      "slug": "c2c-block",
      "term": "C2C block",
      "definition": "A unit of corner-to-corner crochet: ch 6, sl st into the 4th ch to form a corner. Work 3 dc into the ch-3 loop just made. Or in later rows: ch 3, work 3 dc into the loop below."
    },
    {
      "slug": "turning-chain",
      "term": "Turning chain",
      "definition": "Chain 6 at the start of increasing rows to set up the next edge block; chain 3 on decreasing rows."
    },
    {
      "slug": "weaving-in-ends",
      "term": "Weaving in ends",
